  description: Thermo Charges were initially developed for asteroid mining and controlled
    demolitions. Their ability to release massive heat in confined spaces made them
    ideal for industrial use. After the outbreak, their design was hastily modified
    for defensive deployment. The line between tool and weapon vanished almost overnight.
  vnDescription: "Ban \u0111\u1EA7u, Thermo Charges \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n
    \u0111\u1EC3 khai th\xE1c ti\u1EC3u h\xE0nh tinh v\xE0 ph\xE1 h\u1EE7y c\xF3
    ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t. Kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng nhi\u1EC7t
    kh\u1ED5ng l\u1ED3 trong kh\xF4ng gian h\u1EA1n h\u1EB9p khi\u1EBFn ch\xFAng
    tr\u1EDF n\xEAn l\xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng cho m\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch c\xF4ng nghi\u1EC7p.
    Sau khi d\u1ECBch b\u1EC7nh b\xF9ng ph\xE1t, thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng
    \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i v\u1ED9i v\xE0ng \u0111\u1EC3
    s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng trong ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7. Ranh gi\u1EDBi gi\u1EEFa c\xF4ng c\u1EE5
    v\xE0 v\u0169 kh\xED g\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t ch\u1EC9 sau m\u1ED9t
    \u0111\xEAm."
